m R at the Department of Physics and Astronomy, Via Marzolo 8, Padua, starting from 9:00 a.m. on the date indicated.\nStudents taking the oral examination via Zoom must connect at 9:00 a.m. on the indicated date using the Zoom link, which will be communicated on Tuesday, June 16.\nInstructions for the Oral Examination\nThe oral examination will last approximately 15 minutes.\nCandidates may begin the interview with a presentation of up to 10 minutes, during which they may use presentation slides (e.g., a PowerPoint presentation).\n***************************************************************************\nDIPARTIMENTO DI FISICA E ASTRONOMIA \"GALILEO GALILEI\"\nAmministrazione trasparente\nPersone\nCONTATTI\nVia F. Marzolo, 8 - 35131 Padova\nTelefono: +39 049 827 7088\nFax: +39 049 827 7102\nPec: dipartimento.dfa(at)pec.unipd.it\nSegnalazioni al webmaster: webmaster(at)dfa.unipd.it\n\u00a9 2018 Universit\u00e0 di Padova - Tutti i diritti riservati\nP.I. 00742430283 C.F. 80006480281\nInformazioni sul sito\n|\nAccessibilit\u00e0\n|\nPrivacy", "links": [["Vai al contenuto", "http://www.dfa.unipd.it/didattica/dottorati-di-ricerca/phd-physics/admission/#main"], ["Uniweb", "https://uniweb.unipd.it/"], ["Unipd", "http://www.unipd.it"], ["Dipartimenti", "http://www.unipd.it/dipartimenti"], ["Scuole", "https://www.unipd.it/scuole"], ["Biblioteche", "http://www.unipd.it/biblioteche"], ["Webmail", "https://www.unipd.it/webmail"], ["SIT", "https://www.unipd.it/sit"], ["GeBeS PTA", "https://apex.cca.unipd.it/pls/apex/f?p=1300:1:114307609289822::NO:1:P0_FSVM_COD_ID,P0_FSVM_NUM_RIG,P0_FSDG_APPP_COD_ID,P0_FSVM_NUM_RIG_MENU_L2,P0_AZIONE,P0_FSNE_COD_NEWS_ID,P0_FSDO_COD_DOC_ID,P0_FSAF_COD_APE_FUN,P0_FSVM_DES_VOCE_MENU,P0_PAGE:925,,54048,,,,,,Home,1"], ["Rubrica", "https://www.unipd.it/rubrica"], ["", "http://www.dfa.unipd.it/"], ["CERCA", "javascript:void(0)"], ["Menu", "javascript:void(0)"], ["ENG", "http://www.dfa.unipd.it/en/"], ["CHIUDI", "javascript:void(0)"], ["Dipartimento", "